{"id":"a477cc53c38e2d75","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-dirichlet-primes.md","title":"Dirichlet's Theorem","display":"df-dirichlet-primes — Dirichlet's Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet-primes","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet-primes"],"display":"df-dirichlet-primes — Dirichlet's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-arithmetic-progression]]","[[58-df-prime-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet-primes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet-primes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet-primes — Dirichlet's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" href=\"?note=6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic-progression\">58-df-arithmetic-progression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"58-df-prime-number\">58-df-prime-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,d\\in\\omega\">\\(a,d\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"58-df-prime-number\">58-df-prime-number</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}primes} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S(a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\omega\\land d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\gcd(a,d)=1\\land \\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(p&gt;N\\land \\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p\\equiv a\\pmod d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}primes} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S(a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\omega\\land d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\gcd(a,d)=1\\land \\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(p&gt;N\\land \\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p\\equiv a\\pmod d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dirichlet characters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi: (\\mathbb{Z}/d\\mathbb{Z})^* \\to \\mathbb{C}^*\">\\(\\chi: (\\mathbb{Z}/d\\mathbb{Z})^* \\to \\mathbb{C}^*\\)</span> detect coprimality.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(1, \\chi) \\neq 0\">\\(L(1, \\chi) \\neq 0\\)</span> for non-principal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> proves infinitude of primes in progression.</li>\n<li>Chebotarev density theorem generalizes Dirichlet to number fields.</li>\n<li>Artin primitive root conjecture relates to Dirichlet characters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-arithmetic-progression","status":"resolved","id":"6c68e3aece7c6ffc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-arithmetic-progression]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-prime-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-prime-number]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,d\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}primes} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletPrimeProgression}_S(a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\omega\\land d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\gcd(a,d)=1\\land \\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(p>N\\land \\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p\\equiv a\\pmod d)","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi: (\\mathbb{Z}/d\\mathbb{Z})^* \\to \\mathbb{C}^*","display":false},{"tex":"L(1, \\chi) \\neq 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-dirichlet-primes.md|58-df-dirichlet-primes]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["6c68e3aece7c6ffc","dad686059f3ca152"]}